["Inactivation of voltage-gated Na+ channels and delayed opening of voltage-gated K+ channels (K+ efflux)", "Opening of voltage-gated Na+ channels and closing of non-gated K+ leak channels", "Inward flux of chloride through GABA-A receptors alone", "Active pumping of sodium by the Na+/K+ ATPase", "Opening of voltage-gated Ca2+ channels and closure of all K+ channels"],
