["Delayed closure of voltage-gated K+ channels driving membrane potential toward EK (-90 mV); defines the Relative Refractory Period", "Persistent opening of voltage-gated Na+ channels; defines the Absolute Refractory Period", "Excessive pumping of the electrogenic Na+/K+ ATPase; defines the Absolute Refractory Period", "Inward leak of extracellular calcium; defines the Latent Period", "Closing of all resting K+ leak channels; defines the Suprathreshold Period"],
