["The resting membrane potential becomes less negative (depolarized), bringing it closer to threshold and initially increasing excitability", "The resting membrane potential becomes more negative (hyperpolarized), decreasing excitability", "The resting membrane potential remains completely unchanged at -70 mV", "The resting membrane potential instantly drops to -120 mV", "The resting membrane potential reverses polarity to +60 mV"],
