["Increased axon diameter (decreases internal longitudinal resistance ri) and myelination (increases membrane resistance rm and decreases membrane capacitance cm)", "Decreased axon diameter (increases resistance) and absence of myelin", "Higher intracellular chloride concentration and reduced sodium channel density", "Decreased distance between nodes of Ranvier and increased membrane capacitance", "Uninterrupted continuous electrotonic spread without saltatory jumping"],
