["Myelination increases rm, thereby increasing lambda, allowing current to travel longer distances along the axon before decaying", "Myelination decreases rm, thereby decreasing lambda, causing rapid signal decay", "Myelination increases ri, thereby decreasing lambda, forcing current through leak channels", "Myelination has zero effect on rm or lambda", "Myelination eliminates the length constant entirely by stopping all ion flow"],
0,
